1
00:00:00,528 --> 00:00:02,198
(Penny:)Yeah.

2
00:00:03,865 --> 00:00:07,365
(Bert:)-Well, see ya.
-You forgot your quartz.

3
00:00:08,102 --> 00:00:10,742
(Bert:)Oh, it's okay.
I want you to have it.

4
00:00:11,873 --> 00:00:13,253
(Leonard:)Bye.

5
00:00:13,841 --> 00:00:15,051
(Amy:)He's nice.

6
00:00:15,209 --> 00:00:17,919
(Howard:)Yeah, he's nice
because he likes you.

7
00:00:18,079 --> 00:00:19,459
(Amy:)What?

8
00:00:19,614 --> 00:00:22,224
(Amy:)-No, he doesn't.
-He brought you a pretty rock.

9
00:00:22,383 --> 00:00:24,553
(Amy:)So? He does that every day--
Oh.

10
00:00:27,021 --> 00:00:28,231
(Howard:)You know, if you'd
rather skip lunch

11
00:00:28,389 --> 00:00:30,769
(Howard:)and hang out with your boyfriend,
Bert, it's totally okay.

12
00:00:30,925 --> 00:00:32,265
(Amy:)He's not my boyfriend.

13
00:00:32,426 --> 00:00:34,206
(Raj:)Are you sure?
He's tall, pale and awkward.

14
00:00:34,362 --> 00:00:36,642
(Raj:)That sounds like your type.

15
00:00:37,098 --> 00:00:39,808
(Amy:)Should someone as lonely as you
really be making fun of me?

16
00:00:39,967 --> 00:00:41,637
(Raj:)Yeah, grow up, Howard. God.

17
00:00:43,537 --> 00:00:46,107
(Amy:)What do I do?
I don't want to hurt his feelings.

18
00:00:46,274 --> 00:00:48,654
(Howard:)Maybe the problem is
he thinks you're available.

19
00:00:48,809 --> 00:00:50,219
(Howard:)Does he know
you're dating Sheldon?

20
00:00:50,378 --> 00:00:52,548
(Amy:)I guess it hasn't come up.

21
00:00:52,713 --> 00:00:54,593
(Howard:)There you go.

22
00:00:54,749 --> 00:00:57,249
(Raj:)And does Sheldon know
you're dating Sheldon?

23
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:02,020
(Amy:)I'm sorry. Who are you dating?

